msgid "Shows, beside a listing and its application, what Eurostat published about the earnings of the listing's group of occupations in its country: a mean, a median and deciles, gross, with the year and the source, and the national minimum wage. A statistic about many jobs, never a recommendation. It reads a file that ships with Postulo, refreshed by an administrator with manage.py fetch_earnings, and asks no service while you work."
